<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French</p>
<p>first division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>6 - Anton Drobjnak (Bastia) </p>
<p>5 - Miladin Becanovic (Lille) </p>
<p>4 - Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux), Christopher Wreh (Guingamp),</p>
<p>Alain Caveglia (Lyon), Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes) </p>
<p>3 - Moussa Saib (Auxerre), Lubomir Moravcik (Bastia), Stephane</p>
<p>Samson (Le Havre), Vladimir Smicer (Lens), Jean-Philippe Durand</p>
<p>(Marseille), Xavier Gravelaine (Marseille), Robert Pires (Metz),</p>
<p>Thierry Henry (Monaco), Enzo Scifo (Monaco)</p>
